  "title": "Beet, Orange, and Apple Salad",
  "description": "This beet and orange salad with beet greens, apple, sunflower seeds, and raspberry vinaigrette is colorful, nourishing, and delicious.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
